      }
    },
    "The neural voice is selected, but its model isn’t downloaded yet. Until then, phrases are spoken with the system voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Выбран нейросетевой голос, но модель ещё не загружена. Пока фразы озвучиваются системным голосом."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recording of this voice is missing. Record it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Запись этого голоса не найдена. Запишите её заново."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sample was longer than 20 seconds, so it was cut at a pause to %lld s.": {
      "localizations": {
